<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Batch6countries-Colombia"><strong>Co=
lombia</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 100=
.0%;">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 22.1754%;">
<col style=3D"width: 35.0439%;">
<col style=3D"width: 31.3938%;">
<col style=3D"width: 11.3869%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Identifiers</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Descriptions</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Regex</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Social Security Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Colombia Social Security Number ma=
tches a valid SSN combined with any of the following keywords within a prox=
imity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de la seguridad social, n=C3=BAmero de segur=
idad social, n.=C2=B0 seguridad social, SSN (or) SSID. (All terms case inse=
nsitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{3}[ -]?\d{2}[ -]?\d{4}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de la seguri=
dad social|n[=C3=BAu]mero de seguridad social|n.[=C2=B0o] seguridad social|=
SSN|SSID)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">123-45-6789</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey"><s=
trong>N=C3=BAmero =C3=9Anico de Identidad Personal - NUIP</strong></th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Colombia National ID Number - NUIP=
 (N=C3=BAmero =C3=9Anico de Identidad Personal) matches a valid NUIP number=
 combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms=
: NIN#, NIN, NUIP, CC, n=C3=BAmero de tarjeta de identidad nacional, n=C3=
=BAmero de tarjeta nacional, n=C3=BAmero =C3=BAnico de identidad personal, =
n=C3=BAmero de identificaci=C3=B3n nacional, tarjeta de identidad, cedula d=
e ciudadan=C3=ADa, cedula, identificaci=C3=B3n nacional (or) Documento naci=
onal de identidad. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</=
td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:\d{8}[. -]?\d{8}|\d{6}|\d{1,2}[. -]?\d{3}[. -=
]?(?:\d{3}[. -])?\d{3,4})</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ti=
tle=3D"Background color :"><strong>National ID Number</strong></td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:NIN\#?|NUIP|CC|n[=C3=BAu]me=
ro de tarjeta de identidad nacional|n[=C3=BAu]mero de tarjeta nacional|n[=
=C3=BAu]mero [=C3=BAu]nico de identidad personal|n[=C3=BAu]mero de identifi=
caci[=C3=B3o]n nacional|tarjeta de identidad|cedula de ciudadan[=C3=ADi]a|c=
edula|identificaci[=C3=B3o]n nacional|Documento nacional de identidad)(?:\b=
|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">1 234 567 890, 01101101 01100001, =
965874, 99.500.2499</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Central Provident Fund Number - CPF</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Passport Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Colombia Passport Number matches a=
 valid passport number combined with any of the following keywords within a=
 proximity of 10 terms: identificaci=C3=B3n para viajes internacionales, de=
talles del pasaporte, visa, documento nacional de identidad, n=C3=BAmero de=
 pasaporte, documento de viaje, autoridad emisora, prueba de identificaci=
=C3=B3n, ID de pasaporte, n.=C2=B0 de pasaporte (or) pasaporte. (All terms =
case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);">(?:[A-Z]{1,2}=
[ -]?\d{5,6}|COL\d{6})</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:identificaci[=C3=B3o]n para=
 viajes internacionales|detalles del pasaporte|visa|documento nacional de i=
dentidad|n[=C3=BAu]mero de pasaporte|documento de viaje|autoridad emisora|p=
rueba de identificaci[=C3=B3o]n|ID de pasaporte|n.[=C2=B0o] de pasaporte|pa=
saporte)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);"=
>EP 000000, AM476709, AO-02001, COL965874</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Driver's License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Colombia Driver's License Number m=
atches a valid license number combined with any of the following keywords w=
ithin a proximity of 10 terms: licencia de tarjeta con foto, licencia estud=
iante, titulares de licencia, titular de licencia, n=C3=BAmero de licencia,=
 licencias de conducir, licencia de conducci=C3=B3n, licencia del conductor=
, licencia de conducir (or) carnet de conducir. (All terms case insensitive=
; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:\d{11,12}|\d{7})</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:licencia de tarjeta con fot=
o|licencia estudiante|titulares de licencia|titular de licencia|n[=C3=BAu]m=
ero de licencia|licencias de conducir|licencia de conducci[=C3=B3o]n|licenc=
ia del conductor|licencia de conducir|carnet de conducir)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">586974389562, 1234567</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey"><s=
trong>Entidad Promotora de Salud - EPS</strong></th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Colombia Social Insurance Number -=
 EPS (Entidad Promotora de Salud) matches a valid EPS number combined with =
any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: sin.=C2=B0, E=
PS, entidad promotora de salud, n=C3=BAmero de seguro social, n.=C2=B0 de s=
eguro social (or) seguro social. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics ar=
e optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{10}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ti=
tle=3D"Background color :"><strong>Social Insurance Number - SIN</strong></=
td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:sin.[=C2=B0o]|EPS|entidad p=
romotora de salud|n[=C3=BAu]mero de seguro social|n.[=C2=B0o] de seguro soc=
ial|seguro social)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[=C2=B0.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">1234567890</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey"><s=
trong>Numero De Identificacion Tributaria - NIT</strong></th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Colombia Tax ID Number - NIT (Nume=
ro De Identificacion Tributaria) matches a valid NIT number combined with a=
ny of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: NIT, numero de=
 identificacion tributaria, n=C3=BAmero de identificaci=C3=B3n fiscal, n=C3=
=BAmero de identidad fiscal, c=C3=B3digo de identificaci=C3=B3n fiscal, arc=
hivo fiscal, n.=C2=B0 de identificaci=C3=B3n fiscal, n=C3=BAmero de registr=
o fiscal, n.=C2=B0 de ID fiscal, n.=C2=B0 fiscal, n=C3=BAmero fiscal, ID fi=
scal, ID del NIF, n.=C2=B0 del NIF (or) NIF. (All terms case insensitive; d=
iacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{3}[. -]?\d{3}[. -]?\d{3}[. -\/]?\d</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ti=
tle=3D"Background color :"><strong>Tax ID Number</strong></td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:NIT|numero de identificacio=
n tributaria|n[=C3=BAu]mero de identificaci[=C3=B3o]n fiscal|n[=C3=BAu]mero=
 de identidad fiscal|c[=C3=B3o]digo de identificaci[=C3=B3o]n fiscal|archiv=
o fiscal|n.[=C2=B0o] de identificaci[=C3=B3o]n fiscal|n[=C3=BAu]mero de reg=
istro fiscal|n.[=C2=B0o] de ID fiscal|n.[=C2=B0o] fiscal|n[=C3=BAu]mero fis=
cal|ID fiscal|ID del NIF|n.[=C2=B0o] del NIF|NIF)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\=
W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">623.456.789-1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">VAT ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Colombia VAT ID Number matches a v=
alid value added tax identification number combined with any of the followi=
ng keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de impuesto sobre e=
l valor agregado, impuesto sobre el valor agregado, n=C3=BAmero de IVA, n.=
=C2=B0 de IVA (or) IVA. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optiona=
l.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);">(?:\d{8,9}[A-=
Z]|\d{9,10})</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de impuesto =
sobre el valor agregado|impuesto sobre el valor agregado|n[=C3=BAu]mero de =
IVA|n.[=C2=B0o] de IVA|IVA)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">91234567A, 012345678A</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
