<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey">Da=
te of Birth</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Phone Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Colombia Phone Number matches a va=
lid phone number combined with any of the following keywords within a proxi=
mity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de tel=C3=A9fono m=C3=B3vil, numero de celula=
r, telefono fijo, n=C3=BAmero de tel=C3=A9fono (or) n=C3=BAmero de m=C3=B3v=
il. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:\+?57|0057|0[1-9]|00)?[- ]?\d{3}[- ]?\d{3,4}[=
- ]?\d{3,5}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de tel[=C3=
=A9e]fono m[=C3=B3o]vil|numero de celular|telefono fijo|n[=C3=BAu]mero de t=
el[=C3=A9e]fono|n[=C3=BAu]mero de m[=C3=B3o]vil)</td>
</tr>
