<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Postcode</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Colombia Postcode matches a valid =
postcode combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of =
10 terms: direcci=C3=B3n, distrito de c=C3=B3digo postal, =C3=A1rea de c=C3=
=B3digo postal, unidad de c=C3=B3digo postal, sector de c=C3=B3digo postal =
(or) codigo postal. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)<=
/td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{6}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:direcci[=C3=B3o]n|distrito =
de c[=C3=B3o]digo postal|[=C3=A1a]rea de c[=C3=B3o]digo postal|unidad de c[=
=C3=B3o]digo postal|sector de c[=C3=B3o]digo postal|codigo postal)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">110221</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">License Plate Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Colombia License Plate Number matc=
hes a valid license plate number combined with any of the following keyword=
s within a proximity of 10 terms: placas de los vehiculos, placa del vehicu=
lo, n.=C2=B0 de registro, n.=C2=B0 de matr=C3=ADcula, n=C3=BAmero de l=C3=
=A1mina licencia, n=C3=BAmero de matr=C3=ADcula, matr=C3=ADcula (or) n=C3=
=BAmero de registro. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)=
</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z0-9]{1,3}[. -]?([A-Z0-9]{1,2}[. -]?)?[A-Z0-9=
]{2,3}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:placas de los vehiculos|pla=
ca del vehiculo|n.[=C2=B0o] de registro|n.[=C2=B0o] de matr[=C3=ADi]cula|n[=
=C3=BAu]mero de l[=C3=A1a]mina licencia|n[=C3=BAu]mero de matr[=C3=ADi]cula=
|matr[=C3=ADi]cula|n[=C3=BAu]mero de registro)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$=
))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">AT.0282, 60-0007, ASD 43, XZF 607<=
/td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#bf2600 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#bf26=
00">Person Name</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey"><s=
trong>SWIFT Code</strong></th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Colombia SWIFT Code matches a vali=
d SWIFT code combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity=
 of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de cuenta bancaria internacional, n.=C2=B0 de IBA=
N, IBAN, codigo swift, SWIFT Code (or) n.=C2=B0 de cuenta bancaria internac=
ional. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z]{4}[ -]?(CO)[ -]?[A-Z0-9]{2}[ -]?([A-Z0-9]{=
3})?</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ti=
tle=3D"Background color :"><strong>International Bank Account Number - IBAN=
</strong></td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de cuenta ba=
ncaria internacional|n.[=C2=B0o] de IBAN|IBAN|SWIFT Code|codigo swift|n.[=
=C2=B0o] de cuenta bancaria internacional)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">AFIUCOBB453</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Bank Account Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Colombia Bank Account Number match=
es a valid bank account number combined with any of the following keywords =
within a proximity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de cuenta bancaria, detalles ba=
ncarios, n=C3=BAmero de banco, c=C3=B3digo de cuenta, ID de cuenta, cuenta =
de ahorros, cuenta corriente, n=C3=BAmero de cuenta (or) cuenta numerada. (=
All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:\d{16,18}|\d{4}[ -]?\d{2}[ -]?\d{4}[ -]?\d{6}=
)</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de cuenta ba=
ncaria|detalles bancarios|n[=C3=BAu]mero de banco|c[=C3=B3o]digo de cuenta|=
ID de cuenta|cuenta de ahorros|cuenta corriente|n[=C3=BAu]mero de cuenta|cu=
enta numerada)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">5678-90-1234-567890</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey">Cr=
