<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Batch6countries-Guatemala"><strong>G=
uatemala</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 100=
.0%;">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 22.1887%;">
<col style=3D"width: 35.0189%;">
<col style=3D"width: 31.3962%;">
<col style=3D"width: 11.3962%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Identifiers</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Descriptions</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Regex</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Social Security Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey">Do=
cumento Personal de Identificaci=C3=B3n - DPI</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Guatemala National ID Number - DPI=
 (Documento Personal de Identificaci=C3=B3n) matches a valid DPI number com=
bined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: NI=
N#, NIN, DPI, n=C3=BAmero de tarjeta de identidad nacional, n=C3=BAmero de =
tarjeta nacional, n=C3=BAmero de identificaci=C3=B3n nacional, identificaci=
=C3=B3n nacional, Documento personal de identificaci=C3=B3n (or) Documento =
nacional de identidad. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional=
.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z]?\d{2,4}[ -]?\d{5,6}[ -]?\d{4}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ti=
tle=3D"Background color :"><strong>National ID Number</strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:NIN\#?|DPI|n[=C3=BAu]mero de tarjeta de i=
dentidad nacional|n[=C3=BAu]mero de tarjeta nacional|n[=C3=BAu]mero de iden=
tificaci[=C3=B3o]n nacional|identificaci[=C3=B3o]n nacional|Documento perso=
nal de identificaci=C3=B3n|Documento nacional de identidad)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[=
.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Example:</=
span></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">2340 75627 0101, N30-888999-1213</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Central Provident Fund Number - CPF</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Passport Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Guatemala Passport Number matches =
a valid passport number combined with any of the following keywords within =
a proximity of 10 terms: identificaci=C3=B3n para viajes internacionales, d=
etalles del pasaporte, visa, documento nacional de identidad, n=C3=BAmero d=
e pasaporte, documento de viaje, autoridad emisora, prueba de identificaci=
=C3=B3n, ID de pasaporte, n.=C2=B0 de pasaporte (or) pasaporte. (All terms =
case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{9,10}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:identificaci[=C3=B3o]n para viajes intern=
acionales|detalles del pasaporte|visa|documento nacional de identidad|n[=C3=
=BAu]mero de pasaporte|documento de viaje|autoridad emisora|prueba de ident=
ificaci[=C3=B3o]n|ID de pasaporte|n.[=C2=B0o] de pasaporte|pasaporte)(?:\b|=
(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Example:</=
span></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">000109196, 0123456789</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Driver's License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Guatemala Driver's License Number =
matches a valid license number combined with any of the following keywords =
within a proximity of 10 terms: licencia de tarjeta con foto, licencia estu=
diante, titulares de licencia, titular de licencia, n=C3=BAmero de licencia=
, licencias de conducir, licencia del conductor, licencia de conducir (or) =
carnet de conducir. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)<=
/td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:\d{13,15}|\d[ -]?\d{6,7})</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:licencia de tarjeta con foto|licencia est=
udiante|titulares de licencia|titular de licencia|n[=C3=BAu]mero de licenci=
a|licencias de conducir|licencia del conductor|licencia de conducir|carnet =
de conducir)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Example:</=
span></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">8-0000345, 123456000969821, 1734539410901</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff" title=3D"Background color : Medium blue 100%">Social Insurance Number -=
 SIN</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Tax ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Guatemala Tax ID Number matches a =
valid Tax Identification Number combined with any of the following keywords=
 within a proximity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de identificaci=C3=B3n fiscal,=
 n=C3=BAmero de identidad fiscal, c=C3=B3digo de identificaci=C3=B3n fiscal=
, archivo fiscal, n.=C2=B0 de identificaci=C3=B3n fiscal, n=C3=BAmero de re=
gistro fiscal, n.=C2=B0 de ID fiscal, n.=C2=B0 fiscal, n=C3=BAmero fiscal, =
ID fiscal, ID del NIF, n.=C2=B0 del NIF (or) NIF. (All terms case insensiti=
ve; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(GT)?[ -]?(NIT)?[ -]?\d{6,7}[ -]?[A-Z0-9]</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de identificaci[=C3=B3o]n =
fiscal|n[=C3=BAu]mero de identidad fiscal|c[=C3=B3o]digo de identificaci[=
=C3=B3o]n fiscal|archivo fiscal|n.[=C2=B0o] de identificaci[=C3=B3o]n fisca=
l|n[=C3=BAu]mero de registro fiscal|n.[=C2=B0o] de ID fiscal|n.[=C2=B0o] fi=
scal|n[=C3=BAu]mero fiscal|ID fiscal|ID del NIF|n.[=C2=B0o] del NIF|NIF)(?:=
\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Example:</=
span></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">GT-NIT-7555605-7, 8977112-5, 576937-K</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff" title=3D"Background color : Medium blue 100%">VAT ID Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Health Service Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Health Insurance Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Guatemala Health Insurance Number =
matches a valid health insurance number combined with any of the following =
keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: cobertura m=C3=A9dica, beneficios =
para la salud, cobertura de atenci=C3=B3n m=C3=A9dica, n=C3=BAmero de salud=
 personal, registro sanitario, n=C3=BAmero de seguro m=C3=A9dico (or) ley d=
e informaci=C3=B3n de salud. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are op=
tional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z0-9]{3}[- ]?\d{6}[- ]?[A-Z0-9]{3}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:cobertura m[=C3=A9e]dica|beneficios para =
la salud|cobertura de atenci[=C3=B3o]n m[=C3=A9e]dica|n[=C3=BAu]mero de sal=
ud personal|registro sanitario|n[=C3=BAu]mero de seguro m[=C3=A9e]dico|ley =
de informaci[=C3=B3o]n de salud)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Example:</=
span></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">ABC-123456-XYZ</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey">Da=
te of Birth</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Phone Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Guatemala Phone Number matches a v=
alid phone number combined with any of the following keywords within a prox=
imity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de tel=C3=A9fono m=C3=B3vil, n=C3=BAmero de =
tel=C3=A9fono (or) n=C3=BAmero de m=C3=B3vil. (All terms case insensitive; =
diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(\d{3})?[ -]?(?:\+?502|00502|00)?[ -]?\d{3,4}[ -=
]?\d{4,5}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de tel[=C3=A9e]fono m[=C3=
=B3o]vil|n[=C3=BAu]mero de tel[=C3=A9e]fono|n[=C3=BAu]mero de m[=C3=B3o]vil=
)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Example:</=
span></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">7543 0891, 011 502 1234 5678, 00502 800 32456, +=
502 2321-0482</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#bf2600 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#bf26=
00">Physical Address</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Postcode</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Guatemala Postcode matches a valid=
 postcode combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of=
 10 terms: direcci=C3=B3n, distrito de c=C3=B3digo postal, =C3=A1rea de c=
=C3=B3digo postal, unidad de c=C3=B3digo postal (or) sector de c=C3=B3digo =
postal. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{5}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:direcci[=C3=B3o]n|distrito de c[=C3=B3o]d=
igo postal|[=C3=A1a]rea de c[=C3=B3o]digo postal|unidad de c[=C3=B3o]digo p=
ostal|sector de c[=C3=B3o]digo postal)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Example:</=
span></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">09001</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">License Plate Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Guatemala License Plate Number mat=
ches a valid license plate number combined with any of the following keywor=
ds within a proximity of 10 terms: n.=C2=B0 de registro, n.=C2=B0 de matr=
=C3=ADcula, n=C3=BAmero de l=C3=A1mina licencia, n=C3=BAmero de matr=C3=ADc=
ula, matr=C3=ADcula (or) n=C3=BAmero de registro. (All terms case insensiti=
ve; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z]{1,3}[. -]?(?:\d{3,4})?[. -]?[A-Z0-9]{3,4}<=
/td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n.[=C2=B0o] de registro|n.[=C2=B0o] de ma=
tr[=C3=ADi]cula|n[=C3=BAu]mero de l[=C3=A1a]mina licencia|n[=C3=BAu]mero de=
 matr[=C3=ADi]cula|matr[=C3=ADi]cula|n[=C3=BAu]mero de registro)(?:\b|(?&lt=
;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Example:</=
span></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">P123ABC, P352700, C 533BGT, PBX 2384</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#bf2600 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#bf26=
00">Person Name</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">International Bank Account Number - IBAN</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Guatemala International Bank Accou=
nt Number - IBAN matches a valid IBAN combined with any of the following ke=
ywords within a proximity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de cuenta bancaria inter=
nacional, n.=C2=B0 de IBAN, IBAN (or) n.=C2=B0 de cuenta bancaria internaci=
onal. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(GT)\d{2}[ ]?[A-Z0-9]{4}[ ]?\d{4}[ ]?\d{4}[ ]?\d=
{4}[ ]?\d{4}[ ]?\d{4}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de cuenta bancaria interna=
cional|n.[=C2=B0o] de IBAN|IBAN|n.[=C2=B0o] de cuenta bancaria internaciona=
l)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Example:</=
span></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">GT82 TRAJ 0102 0000 0012 1002 9690</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Bank Account Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Guatemala Bank Account Number matc=
hes a valid bank account number combined with any of the following keywords=
 within a proximity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de cuenta bancaria, detalles b=
ancarios, n=C3=BAmero de banco, c=C3=B3digo de cuenta, ID de cuenta, n=C3=
=BAmero de cuenta (or) cuenta numerada. (All terms case insensitive; diacri=
tics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{20}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de cuenta bancaria|detalle=
s bancarios|n[=C3=BAu]mero de banco|c[=C3=B3o]digo de cuenta|ID de cuenta|n=
[=C3=BAu]mero de cuenta|cuenta numerada)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Example:</=
span></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">01020000001210029690</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey">Cr=
edit Card Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
