<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Batch6countries-Iceland"><strong>Ice=
land</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 22.1754%;">
<col style=3D"width: 35.0439%;">
<col style=3D"width: 31.3938%;">
<col style=3D"width: 11.3869%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Identifiers</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Descriptions</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Regex</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Social Security Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">National ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Iceland National ID Number matches=
 a valid National Identity Card Number combined with any of the following k=
eywords within a proximity of 10 terms: NIN#, NIN, Kennitala, national iden=
tity card number, national card number, national card no, national identifi=
cation number (or) national id. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:(0[1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[01])(0[1-9]|[1][0-2])\d{2=
}[- ]?\d{3}(9|0))</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:NIN\#?|Kennitala|national identity card n=
umber|national card number|national card no|national identification number|=
national id)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><strong><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);" ti=
tle=3D"">Example:</span></strong></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">120174-3399</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Central Provident Fund Number - CPF</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Passport Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Iceland Passport Number matches a =
valid passport number combined with any of the following keywords within a =
proximity of 10 terms: identification for international travel, passport de=
tails, visa, passport number, travel document, issuing authority, proof of =
identification, passportid, passportno. (or) passport. (All terms case inse=
nsitive.)</td>
