<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Kuwait International Bank Account =
Number - IBAN matches a valid IBAN combined with any of the following keywo=
rds within a proximity of 10 terms: =D8=B1=D9=82=D9=85 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AD=
=D8=B3=D8=A7=D8=A8 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=A8=D9=86=D9=83=D9=8A =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AF=
=D9=88=D9=84=D9=8A, IBAN# (or) IBAN. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(KW)\d{2}[ ]?[A-Z0-9]{4}[ ]?\d{4}[ ]?\d{4}[ ]?\d=
{4}[ ]?\d{4}[ ]?\d{4}[ ]?\d{2}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:=D8=B1=D9=82=D9=85 =D8=A7=
=D9=84=D8=AD=D8=B3=D8=A7=D8=A8 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=A8=D9=86=D9=83=D9=8A =D8=A7=
=D9=84=D8=AF=D9=88=D9=84=D9=8A|IBAN#|IBAN)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">KW81 CBKU 0000 0000 0000 1234 5601=
 01</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Bank Account Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Kuwait Bank Account Number matches=
 a valid bank account number combined with any of the following keywords wi=
thin a proximity of 10 terms: =D8=B1=D9=82=D9=85 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AD=D8=B3=
=D8=A7=D8=A8 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=A8=D9=86=D9=83=D9=8A, =D8=AA=D9=81=D8=A7=D8=B5=
=D9=8A=D9=84 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=A8=D9=86=D9=83, =D8=B1=D9=82=D9=85 =D8=A7=D9=
=84=D8=A8=D9=86=D9=83, =D9=83=D9=88=D8=AF =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AD=D8=B3=D8=A7=D8=
=A8, =D9=85=D8=B9=D8=B1=D9=91=D9=81 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AD=D8=B3=D8=A7=D8=A8, =
=D8=B1=D9=82=D9=85 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AD=D8=B3=D8=A7=D8=A8 (or) =D8=A7=D9=84=
=D8=AD=D8=B3=D8=A7=D8=A8 =D8=A7=D9=84=D9=85=D9=8F=D8=B1=D9=82=D9=91=D9=8E=
=D9=85.</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{22}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:=D8=B1=D9=82=D9=85 =D8=A7=
=D9=84=D8=AD=D8=B3=D8=A7=D8=A8 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=A8=D9=86=D9=83=D9=8A|=D8=AA=
=D9=81=D8=A7=D8=B5=D9=8A=D9=84 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=A8=D9=86=D9=83|=D8=B1=D9=82=
=D9=85 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=A8=D9=86=D9=83|=D9=83=D9=88=D8=AF =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AD=
=D8=B3=D8=A7=D8=A8|=D9=85=D8=B9=D8=B1=D9=91=D9=81 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AD=D8=B3=
=D8=A7=D8=A8|=D8=B1=D9=82=D9=85 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AD=D8=B3=D8=A7=D8=A8|=D8=A7=
=D9=84=D8=AD=D8=B3=D8=A7=D8=A8 =D8=A7=D9=84=D9=85=D9=8F=D8=B1=D9=82=D9=91=
=D9=8E=D9=85)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
