</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Business Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Kuwait Business Number matches a v=
alid business number combined with any of the following keywords within a p=
roximity of 10 terms: =D8=B1=D9=82=D9=85 =D8=A7=D9=84=D9=86=D8=B4=D8=A7=D8=
=B7 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AA=D8=AC=D8=A7=D8=B1=D9=8A, #=D9=85=D8=B9=D8=B1=D9=81 =
=D8=A7=D9=84=D9=86=D8=B4=D8=A7=D8=B7 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AA=D8=AC=D8=A7=D8=B1=
=D9=8A (or) =D9=85=D8=B9=D8=B1=D9=81 =D8=A7=D9=84=D9=86=D8=B4=D8=A7=D8=B7 =
=D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AA=D8=AC=D8=A7=D8=B1=D9=8A#.</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(CR)?\d{7}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:=D8=B1=D9=82=D9=85 =D8=A7=
=D9=84=D9=86=D8=B4=D8=A7=D8=B7 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AA=D8=AC=D8=A7=D8=B1=D9=8A|#=
=D9=85=D8=B9=D8=B1=D9=81 =D8=A7=D9=84=D9=86=D8=B4=D8=A7=D8=B7 =D8=A7=D9=84=
=D8=AA=D8=AC=D8=A7=D8=B1=D9=8A|=D9=85=D8=B9=D8=B1=D9=81 =D8=A7=D9=84=D9=86=
=D8=B4=D8=A7=D8=B7 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AA=D8=AC=D8=A7=D8=B1=D9=8A#)(?:\b|(?&lt;=
=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
