</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Company Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Kuwait Company Number matches a va=
lid company number combined with any of the following keywords within a pro=
ximity of 10 terms: =D8=B1=D9=82=D9=85 =D8=A7=D9=84=D9=86=D8=B4=D8=A7=D8=B7=
 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AA=D8=AC=D8=A7=D8=B1=D9=8A (or) =D9=85=D8=B9=D8=B1=D9=81 =
=D8=A7=D9=84=D9=86=D8=B4=D8=A7=D8=B7 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AA=D8=AC=D8=A7=D8=B1=
=D9=8A.</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{5}[- ]?\d{4}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:=D8=B1=D9=82=D9=85 =D8=A7=
=D9=84=D9=86=D8=B4=D8=A7=D8=B7 =D8=A7=D9=84=D8=AA=D8=AC=D8=A7=D8=B1=D9=8A|=
=D9=85=D8=B9=D8=B1=D9=81 =D8=A7=D9=84=D9=86=D8=B4=D8=A7=D8=B7 =D8=A7=D9=84=
=D8=AA=D8=AC=D8=A7=D8=B1=D9=8A)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77=
);">Example:</span></th>
