<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Batch6countries-Malaysia"><strong>Ma=
laysia</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 100=
.0%;">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 22.2057%;">
<col style=3D"width: 35.0224%;">
<col style=3D"width: 31.3711%;">
<col style=3D"width: 11.4009%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Identifiers</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Descriptions</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Regex</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Social Security Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#36b37e confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#36b3=
7e" title=3D"Background color : Medium green 100%">National ID Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Central Provident Fund Number - CPF</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#36b37e confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#36b3=
7e">Passport Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#ffab00 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffab=
00" rowspan=3D"2">Driver's License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Malaysia Driver's License Number m=
atches a valid license number combined with any of the following keywords w=
ithin a proximity of 10 terms: lesen kad foto, pemandu pelajar, pemegang le=
sen, nombor lesen, license holder, learner driver, driver's license, lesen =
memandu (or) lesen pemandu. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">([A-Za-z]{2}|\d{2})[ ]?\d{3}[ ]?\d{3}|\d{12})</t=
d>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:lesen kad foto|pemandu pelajar|pemegang l=
esen|nombor lesen|license holder|learner driver|driver's license|lesen mema=
ndu|lesen pemandu)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey"><s=
trong title=3D""><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Example:</span></str=
ong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">861031386423, 860119145222</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Social Insurance Number - SIN</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#ffab00 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffab=
00" rowspan=3D"2">Tax ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Malaysia Tax ID Number matches a v=
alid Tax Identification Number combined with any of the following keywords =
within a proximity of 10 terms: nombor pengenalan cukai, nombor identiti cu=
kai, kod pengenalan cukai, nombor pendaftaran cukai, no pengenalan cukai, f=
ail cukai, nombor id cukai, nomborcukai#, nomborcukai, noidcukai#, noidcuka=
i, nocukai#, nocukai, idcukai#, idcukai, id tin, no tin, tin# (or) TIN. (Al=
l terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">((SG|OG)[ ]\d{11})|([A-Z]{1,2}[ ]\d{10})</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:nombor pengenalan cukai|nombor identiti c=
ukai|kod pengenalan cukai|nombor pendaftaran cukai|no pengenalan cukai|fail=
 cukai|nombor id cukai|nomborcukai\#?|noidcukai\#?|nocukai\#?|idcukai\#?|id=
 tin|no tin|tin\#?|TIN)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey"><s=
trong title=3D""><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Example:</span></str=
ong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">C 5628197301</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#ffab00 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffab=
00" rowspan=3D"2">VAT ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Malaysia VAT ID Number matches a v=
alid value added tax identification number combined with any of the followi=
ng keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: nombor cukai nilai tambah, cuka=
i nilai tambah, sales and service Tax, SST, GST, Cukai jualan dan Perkhidma=
tan, nombor vat, no. vat, no vat, vat# (or) VAT. (All terms case insensitiv=
e.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(MYW)?\d{14}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:nombor cukai nilai tambah|cukai nilai tam=
bah|sales and service Tax|SST|GST|Cukai jualan dan Perkhidmatan|nombor vat|=
no. vat|no vat|vat\#?|VAT)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey"><s=
trong><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);" title=3D"">Example:</span></str=
ong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">MYW83467852164974</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Health Service Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#0065ff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065=
ff">Health Insurance Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey">Da=
te of Birth</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#ffab00 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffab=
00" rowspan=3D"2">Phone Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Malaysia Phone Number matches a va=
lid phone number combined with any of the following keywords within a proxi=
mity of 10 terms: nombor telefon mudah alih, nombor telefon bimbit, nombor =
telefon (or) no telefon.</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{2}[ -]?\d{8}|\d{3}[- ]?\d{7}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:nombor telefon mudah alih|nombor telefon =
bimbit|nombor telefon|no telefon)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey"><s=
trong><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);" title=3D"">Example:</span></str=
ong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">13-12345678</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#bf2600 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#bf26=
00">Physical Address</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#ffab00 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffab=
00" rowspan=3D"2">Postcode</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Malaysia Postcode matches a valid =
postcode combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of =
10 terms: alamat, daerah poskod, kawasan poskod, unit poskod, sektor poskod=
, Post code (or) poskod. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{5}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:alamat|daerah poskod|kawasan poskod|unit =
poskod|sektor poskod|Post code|poskod)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);" ti=
tle=3D"">Example:</span></strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">50250, 06720</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">License Plate Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Malaysia License Plate Number matc=
hes a valid license plate number combined with any of the following keyword=
s within a proximity of 10 terms: nombor plat lesen, nombor lesen, plat les=
en, plate number, registration number, vehicle registration number, vehicle=
 plate number, pendaftaran kenderaan, no. pendaftaran., no. plat. (or) nomb=
or pendaftaran. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:[A-Z0-9]{1,3}[ -]?\d{2,4}[ -]?[A-Z0-9]{1,2}|[=
A-Z0-9]{1,3}[ -]?\d{3,4})</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:nombor plat lesen|nombor lesen|plat lesen=
|plate number|registration number|vehicle registration number|vehicle plate=
 number|pendaftaran kenderaan|no. pendaftaran.|no. plat.|nombor pendaftaran=
)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);" ti=
tle=3D"">Example:</span></strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">PFQ 5217, A 2341 A, 12-34-DC, GG 2007 BQ</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-#bf2600 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#bf26=
00">Person Name</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey"><s=
trong>SWIFT Code</strong></th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Malaysia SWIFT Code matches a vali=
d SWIFT code combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity=
 of 10 terms: Nombor Akaun Bank Antarabangsa, No akaun bank antarabangsa, S=
WIFT Code, BIC code, IBAN# (or) IBAN. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z]{4}(MY)[A-Z0-9]{2}(\d{3})?</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ti=
tle=3D"Background color :"><strong>International Bank Account Number - IBAN=
</strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:Nombor Akaun Bank Antarabangsa|No akaun b=
ank antarabangsa|SWIFT Code|BIC code|IBAN\#?)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$)=
)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);" ti=
tle=3D"">Example:</span></strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">AUCDMYB3301</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Bank Account Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Malaysia Bank Account Number match=
es a valid bank account number combined with any of the following keywords =
within a proximity of 10 terms: nombor akaun bank, butiran bank, nombor ban=
k, kod bank, id akaun, nombor akaun (or) akaun bernombor.</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{7,20}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:nombor akaun bank|butiran bank|nombor ban=
k|kod bank|id akaun|nombor akaun|akaun bernombor)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);" ti=
tle=3D"">Example:</span></strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">514187215055</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey">Cr=
edit Card Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Routing Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Malaysia Routing Number matches a =
valid routing number combined with any of the following keywords within a p=
roximity of 10 terms: nombor penghalaan, penghalaan bank#, no penghalaan, p=
enghalaan#, penghalaan, BIC code, IBG routing (or) RTN. (All terms case ins=
ensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);">(?:\d{9}|[A-Z=
]{6}\d{2}[A-Z]{3})</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:nombor penghalaan|penghalaan bank\#?|no p=
enghalaan|penghalaan\#?|BIC code|IBG routing|RTN)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\=
W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);" ti=
tle=3D"">Example:</span></strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);">100002128, TB=
NFFR43PAR</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Business Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Malaysia Business Number matches a=
 valid business number combined with any of the following keywords within a=
 proximity of 10 terms: Business registration number, nombor pendaftaran pe=
rniagaan, nombor perniagaan, no perniagaan, ID perniagaan, idperniagaan#, n=
operniagaan# (or) noperniagaan. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:\d{7}[ -]?[A-Z]|\d{4}[ -]?\d{2}[ -]?\d{6})</t=
d>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:Business registration number|nombor penda=
ftaran perniagaan|nombor perniagaan|no perniagaan|ID perniagaan|idperniagaa=
n\#?|noperniagaan\#?)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);" ti=
tle=3D"">Example:</span></strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">1234567-A, 202201234565</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Company Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Malaysia Company Number matches a =
valid company number combined with any of the following keywords within a p=
roximity of 10 terms: nombor pengenalan korporat, nombor pendaftaran syarik=
at, nombor korporat, nombor syarikat, no syarikat# (or) no syarikat. (All t=
erms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:\d{7}[ -]?[A-Z]|\d{4}[ -]?\d{2}[ -]?\d{6})</t=
d>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:Company registration number|nombor pengen=
alan korporat|nombor pendaftaran syarikat|nombor korporat|nombor syarikat|n=
o syarikat\#?)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);" ti=
tle=3D"">Example:</span></strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">1280458-D, 201801018442</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
