<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">National ID Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Panama National ID Number matches =
a valid National Identity Card Number combined with any of the following ke=
ywords within a proximity of 10 terms: NIN#, NIN, n=C3=BAmero de tarjeta de=
 identidad nacional, n=C3=BAmero de tarjeta nacional, n=C3=BAmero de identi=
ficaci=C3=B3n nacional, identificaci=C3=B3n nacional (or) Documento naciona=
l de identidad. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:\d{8,9}|\d{6})</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:NIN\#?|n[=C3=BAu]mero de tarjeta de ident=
idad nacional|n[=C3=BAu]mero de tarjeta nacional|n[=C3=BAu]mero de identifi=
caci[=C3=B3o]n nacional|identificaci[=C3=B3o]n nacional|Documento nacional =
de identidad)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
