<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ro=
wspan=3D"2">Passport Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Panama Passport Number matches a v=
alid passport number combined with any of the following keywords within a p=
roximity of 10 terms: identificaci=C3=B3n para viajes internacionales, deta=
lles del pasaporte, visa, documento nacional de identidad, n=C3=BAmero de p=
asaporte, documento de viaje, autoridad emisora, prueba de identificaci=C3=
=B3n, ID de pasaporte, n.=C2=B0 de pasaporte (or) pasaporte. (All terms cas=
e insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?:[A-Z]{2})?\d{7}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:identificaci[=C3=B3o]n para viajes intern=
acionales|detalles del pasaporte|visa|documento nacional de identidad|n[=C3=
=BAu]mero de pasaporte|documento de viaje|autoridad emisora|prueba de ident=
ificaci[=C3=B3o]n|ID de pasaporte|n.[=C2=B0o] de pasaporte|pasaporte)(?:\b|=
(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><strong><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);" ti=
tle=3D"">Example:</span></strong></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">PA0640874, 1988208</td>
